  "notes": "College of Arts and Sciences, Department of Psychological and Brain Sciences B.A. in Psychology (bulletin 2026-2027). Major: entry sequence (PSY-P 101, P 102, P 199, P 211); PSY-K 300 Statistical Techniques; foundational courses P 304, P 335, P 346; one advanced psychology course; two psychology electives; one capstone (P 404/421/424/426/429/433/435/436/493/494/499). Also requires MATH-M 118 or higher (C- or higher) and one semester of biology (C- or higher). Students complete CASE College and IU Common Ground requirements. Minimum 2.0 GPA.",
